    "summary": "React immediately after an enemy picks targets in its Shooting phase or either Fight phase. Pick a DRUKHARI unit of yours among those targets. Gain one Pain token and spend one to worsen AP by 1 on that enemy’s attacks against your pick until it finishes attacking. Gain one Pain token at phase end if your HAEMONCULUS COVENS pick survives.",
